   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/inspection/HIOrdersInteractionDialogPluginImpl.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 87,
   "en": "A total of %s should be enough to get the job done. and guarantees that your standing with the Hegemony will not suffer.",
